title: Ministry of the Vice-Presidency
new-page: true
view-if: generalitat_vp_timer <= 0 and (vicepresident_party == player_party) and not cat_caretaker_gov
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; generalitat_vp_timer += 4;
is-card: true
card-image: img/cat_seal.svg
face-image: img/cat_seal.svg
frequency: 100
tags: generalitat
role: card-gov

= Ministry of the Vice-Presidency

More options are TODO!

- @other_ministry
- @post_event: We don't want to do anything in this ministry at the moment
- @easy_discard


@other_ministry
title: Intervene in one of our controlled ministries

Which ministry should we intervene in?

- @economy: Ministry of the Economy
- @health: Ministry of Health
- @education: Ministry of Education
- @interior: Ministry of the Interior
- @foreign: Ministry of Foreign Affairs
- @bnl: Ministry of Business and Labour
- @territory: Ministry of Territory
- @post_event: We actually don't want to do anything in this ministry at the moment

@economy
view-if: economy_minister_party == player_party or (player_in_jxsi and economy_minister_party == "jxsi") or (player_in_jxcat and economy_minister_party == "jxcat")
go-to: generalitat_economy_card

